<h2>Next steps</h2>
<p>Once you have a few brands in mind, narrow down by board type with our <%= link_to "guide to choosing a snowboard", guide_path("best-snowboard") %>, then confirm your length with the <%= link_to "snowboard size chart", snowboard_size_chart_path %>. Riding demo boards from two or three brands is the most reliable way to find what you like.</p>

